      "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in me \nby the Constitution and statutes of the \nUnited States, particularly the First War \nPowers Act, 1941 (Public Law 354—77th \nCongress), it is hereby ordered that the \nfunctions, powers, and duties of the \nUnited States High Commissioner to the \nPhilippine Islands, together with the per­\nsonnel, records, property, and funds of \nthe office of the High Commissioner, be, \nand they are hereby, transferred to the \nSecretary of the Interior."
    }
  ],
